d 'LOGISTIC_SCORES': module to calculate logistic scores from ordinal data
d
d  logistic_scores calculates logistic scores in the sense of
d Mosteller and Tukey (Data Analysis and Regression, 1977) from a
d graded ordinal variable. 
d
d KW: logistic scores
d KW: Mosteller
d KW: Tukey
d KW: ordinal data 
d
d Requires: Stata version 9
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d
f logistic_scores.ado
f logistic_scores.sthlp
f logistic_scores_examples.do
f logistic_scores_derivation.pdf
